# PUBLIC REPO. Anything committed here is visible to the world.
#
# This visualiser reads its data in the browser (drag-and-drop / file picker,
# accept=".csv,.txt") — no real data file ever needs to be committed. So data
# and document formats are blocked BY DEFAULT, and anything genuinely meant for
# publication has to be un-ignored deliberately below.
#
# Why deny-by-default: since 2026-07-29 sync.ps1 commits and pushes automatically,
# so a file left in this folder would be published without anyone reviewing it.
# Rule of thumb: synthetic fixtures only, never real ITCMS/HBD exports or site IDs.

# --- tabular / data exports ---
*.csv
*.tsv
*.psv
*.txt
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.ods
*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- JSON is a common export format, so block it too. Tooling files are
#     re-included; add others explicitly if the project ever needs them.
*.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!.github/**/*.json

# --- documents and mail (reports, extracts, correspondence) ---
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.msg
*.eml

# --- archives (an easy way to smuggle a data folder in) ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.gz

# --- folders that tend to accumulate real data ---
sample-data/
data/
exports/
raw/

# --- deliberate escape hatch --------------------------------------------------
# Synthetic, hand-made fixtures are allowed, but must be named so it is obvious
# they are fake, and must live in fixtures/. Nothing else gets through.
!fixtures/synthetic-*.csv
!fixtures/synthetic-*.json

# --- private working notes — never publish ---
HANDOFF.md

# --- local / OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
